{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in the 1950's at the Limestone Coast, South Australia. A robot is sent to an unexplored underwater cave to gather and test a phosphorescent fungus that is extracted from pieces of driftwood located throughout the cave system. The player's objective is to collect all of the different fish and plants that can be found in the cave. There are also landmarks that needs to be discovered which can be utilised by the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SOLO DEVELOPED</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FREE TO PLAY</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and collect fish and plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find landmarks and use them for your benefit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple and easy to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a classified mission that took place in the 1950's</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax and enjoy the underwater vibe</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342050?t=1735337617","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342050?t=1735337617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342050/1feb8fe5949fd121a881936dd9cfd6170dcbf801/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1735337617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342050/1feb8fe5949fd121a881936dd9cfd6170dcbf801/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1735337617","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in the 1950's at the Limestone Coast, South Australia. A robot is sent to an unexplored underwater cave to gather and test a phosphorescent fungus that is extracted from pieces of driftwood located t